<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Nothing’s quite so precious</l><l>As Jesus in my spirit.</l><l>He turns my heart to Him,</l><l>To feast upon His life.</l><l>It’s nothing I do—</l><l>His mercy’s just upon me.</l><l>And God’s free gift of grace</l><l>Becomes an endless joy to me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
